msgid "Account Cash"
msgstr "Kasos knygos ataskaita"

#: ../../content/via_laurea_modules/accounting/payments/cash_account.rst:7
msgid "You can print the cash_account book through Reports -> Cash Journal."
msgstr "Kasos knygą atsispausditi galite per Ataskaitos -> Kasos žurnalas."

