#: ../../content/via_laurea_modules/accounting/payments/cash_account.rst:14
msgid ""
"In the opened window, select the period for which you want to print the "
"cash_account book."
msgstr ""
"Atsidariusiame lange pasirenkama, už kokį laikotarpį norima spausdinti "
"Kasos knygą."

#: ../../content/via_laurea_modules/accounting/payments/cash_account.rst:16
msgid "**Journal**: Select the cash_account journal."
msgstr "**Žurnalas**: pasirenkamas kasos žurnalas."

#: ../../content/via_laurea_modules/accounting/payments/cash_account.rst:17
msgid ""
"**Cash Journal Print Type**: Choose how you want to display the "
