#: ../../content/via_laurea_modules/accounting/payments/cash_account.rst:18
msgid "**Employee**: Select the employee responsible for cash_account operations."
msgstr "**Darbuotojas**: parenkamas darbuotojas, atsakingas už kasos operacijas."

#: ../../content/via_laurea_modules/accounting/payments/cash_account.rst:19
