msgstr "Viena ataskaita lape atspausdinus atrodo taip:"

#: ../../content/via_laurea_modules/accounting/payments/cash_account.rst:31
msgid "Two reports printed on one page look like this:"
msgstr "​Dvi ataskaitos viename lape atspausdinus atrodo taip:"

#: ../../content/via_laurea_modules/accounting/payments/cash_account.rst:35
msgid ""
"The report is closely related to the functionality of KIO and KPO (see "
