#: ../../content/via_laurea_modules/payroll/declarations/2-SD.rst:43
msgid ""
"You can create a 2-SD .ffdata file without filling in the fields in the "
"employee's employment contract, but in this case, these fields will have "
"to be filled in directly on the Sodra page after uploading the file "
