#: ../../content/via_laurea_modules/payroll/declarations/GPM_313.rst:2
#
msgid "GPM 313 declaration"
msgstr "GPM 313 deklaracija"

#: ../../content/via_laurea_modules/payroll/declarations/GPM_313.rst:6
msgid ""
"This declaration is intended to declare the amounts of money credited to "
"employees and individuals as well as the deducted GPM, when the income is"
" classified as class A income. The declaration for the benefits paid in "
"the current month is submitted by the 15th day of the following month. "
"The declaration is submitted every month."
msgstr ""
"Ši deklaracija skirta deklaruoti darbuotojams bei fiziniams asmenims priskaitytas "
"pinigų sumas bei išskaitytą GPM, kai pajamos priskiriamos A klasės "
"pajamoms. Deklaracija už einamąjį mėnesį išmokėtas išmokas teikiama iki sekančio "
"mėnesio 15 dienos. Deklaracija teikiama kiekvieną mėnesį."

#: ../../content/via_laurea_modules/payroll/declarations/GPM_313.rst:10
#
msgid ""
"The GPM 313 module (technical name l10n_lt_gpm313) is installed, and the "
"Lithuanian Payroll module (technical name l10n_lt_hr_payroll_vl) is also "
"required."
msgstr ""
"Įdiegiamas modulis GPM 313 (techn.pavadinimas l10n_lt_gpm313 ), taip "
"pat reikalingas modulis Lithuanian Payroll (techn.pavadinimas l10n_lt_hr_payroll_vl)."

#: ../../content/via_laurea_modules/payroll/declarations/GPM_313.rst:14
#
msgid ""
"You can find the monthly GPM declaration in the Payroll module >> Reports"
" >> EDS section >> GPM313 report."
msgstr ""
"Mėnesinę GPM deklaraciją rasite Algalapio modulyje >> Ataskaitose >> "
"skiltyje EDS >> GPM313 ataskaita."

#
msgid "Finding the GPM 313 declaration"
