"In cases where an employee must be paid an average wage (or part thereof)"
" in accordance with the Labor Code or other labor law provisions or an "
"employment contract, a certificate must be printed showing how that "
"average salary was calculated."
msgstr ""
"Tais atvejais, kai darbuotojui pagal Darbo kodeksą ar kitas darbo teisės "
"normas ar darbo sutartį turi būti mokamas vidutinis darbo užmokestis "
"(arba jo dalis), reikia atspausdinti pažymą, kaip tas vidutinis DU buvo "
"apskaičiuotas."

#: ../../content/via_laurea_modules/payroll/reports/certificate_of_average_earnings.rst:8
#: ../../content/via_laurea_modules/payroll/reports/payroll_sheet.rst:8
#: ../../content/via_laurea_modules/payroll/reports/salary_certificate.rst:10
#: ../../content/via_laurea_modules/payroll/reports/timesheets.rst:8
